1:["$","main",null,{"className":"task-page","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"site-header","children":[["$","a",null,{"className":"header-name","href":"/","aria-label":"AI Infra Bench","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"header-wordmark","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"AI"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"header-infra-i"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"nfra Bench"}]]}]}],["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"Primary navigation","children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"/#tasks","children":"Tasks"}],["$","a",null,{"href":"https://github.com/ai-infra-bench/ai-infra-bench","children":"GitHub"}]]}]]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"task-detail","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"task-detail-heading","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"PyAV Target Frame Selection"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Return the requested temporal video frames when decoding sampled inputs with PyAV."}]]}],["$","$La",null,{"instructionHtml":"<p>While checking that the PyAV video backend is compatible with the existing OpenCV backend, I decoded <code>/opt/video/sintel-trailer.mp4</code> with <code>num_frames=8</code> through both backends.</p>\n<p>Both backends report the same target positions and return arrays with the same shape and dtype. OpenCV returns the requested moments, but several PyAV frames come from different moments even though they are reported at those target positions.</p>\n<p>Make PyAV return the frames from the requested moments throughout the existing video-loading interface. Preserve its existing sampling behavior and metadata, keep it on its own PyAV decoding path, and avoid affecting other video loads.</p>","verifierFiles":[{"name":"test.sh","lineCount":28,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-pyav-target-frame-selection/tests/0.json"},{"name":"check_junit.py","lineCount":37,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-pyav-target-frame-selection/tests/1.json"},{"name":"test_real_video_loading.py","lineCount":85,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-pyav-target-frame-selection/tests/2.json"},{"name":"test_regression.py","lineCount":175,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-pyav-target-frame-selection/tests/3.json"},{"name":"video_verifier_support.py","lineCount":211,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-pyav-target-frame-selection/tests/4.json"}],"solutionFiles":[{"name":"solve.sh","lineCount":5,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-pyav-target-frame-selection/solution/0.json"},{"name":"oracle.patch","lineCount":46,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-pyav-target-frame-selection/solution/1.json"}],"environmentFiles":[{"name":"Dockerfile","lineCount":727,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-pyav-target-frame-selection/environment/0.json"},{"name":"image-manifest.json","lineCount":47,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-pyav-target-frame-selection/environment/1.json"},{"name":"lock/manifest.json","lineCount":37,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-pyav-target-frame-selection/environment/2.json"},{"name":"lock/requirements.txt","lineCount":574,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-pyav-target-frame-selection/environment/3.json"}],"metadataGroups":[{"title":"Task","facts":[["Workload Type","Bug Fix"],["Subsystems","Input Processing Multimodal"]]},{"title":"Compute","facts":[["Accelerator","CPU"],["Topology","Not applicable"],["CPUs","8 cores"],["Memory","48 GB"],["Storage","20 GB"],["Network","No Network"],["Working directory","/workspace/vllm"],["Build timeout","240 min"]]},{"title":"Execution","facts":[["Agent Timeout","600 min"],["Agent User","root"],["Agent Network","No Network"],["Verifier Timeout","15 min"]]}]}]]}],["$","nav",null,{"className":"task-sequence-nav","aria-label":"Adjacent tasks","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/tasks/vllm-persistent-kv-layout-namespace.html","children":[["$","svg",null,{"width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 15 15","fill":"none","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","aria-hidden":"true","ref":"$undefined","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M6.85355 3.14645C7.04882 3.34